{"version":1,"content":"<p>名古屋亞殘運會將於今日（24日）閉幕，香港隊共取得41面獎牌。</p><p>特首李家超祝賀運動員取得佳績，並讚揚運動員優秀的表現和崇高的體育精神，指香港隊在今屆亞殘運會表現優秀。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T09:22:09.026560+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":83,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T08:00:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-25T01:38:15.457602+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T09:18:12.277746+00:00","content_hash":"7a5c2e731cd98ed87b0e17dbd54cc8e55d92e1b7bf935b4b9d63191af42d8365","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}